    },
    {
      "id": "candidate-text-018",
      "hexagramId": "hexagram-kw-02",
      "linePosition": null,
      "textKind": "hexagram_judgment",
      "text": "坤：元亨，利牝馬之貞。君子有攸往，先迷後得主，利。西南得朋，東北喪朋。安貞吉。",
      "source": {
        "sourceId": "module-four-acceptance-pack",
        "sourceVersion": "2026-07-25-candidate-v1",
        "sourceLocator": "六爻App模块四内容数据库缺失数据补全与生产验收包.txt",
        "revision": null,
        "sourceSha256": "537d3ec190263166c1a3f541c962c44ce12bec47ba30b5c8cdc2a8841c8953a4",
        "verificationStatus": "production_candidate"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "candidate-text-019",
      "hexagramId": "hexagram-kw-02",
      "linePosition": null,
      "textKind": "tuan_commentary",
      "text": "彖曰：至哉坤元，萬物資生，乃順承天。坤厚載物，德合無疆。含弘光大，品物咸亨。牝馬地類，行地無疆，柔順利貞。君子攸行，先迷失道，後順得常。西南得朋，乃與類行；東北喪朋，乃終有慶。安貞之吉，應地無疆。",
      "source": {
        "sourceId": "module-four-acceptance-pack",
        "sourceVersion": "2026-07-25-candidate-v1",
        "sourceLocator": "六爻App模块四内容数据库缺失数据补全与生产验收包.txt",
        "revision": null,
        "sourceSha256": "537d3ec190263166c1a3f541c962c44ce12bec47ba30b5c8cdc2a8841c8953a4",
        "verificationStatus": "production_candidate"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "candidate-text-020",
      "hexagramId": "hexagram-kw-02",
      "linePosition": null,
      "textKind": "great_image",
      "text": "象曰：地勢坤，君子以厚德載物。",
      "source": {
        "sourceId": "module-four-acceptance-pack",
        "sourceVersion": "2026-07-25-candidate-v1",
        "sourceLocator": "六爻App模块四内容数据库缺失数据补全与生产验收包.txt",
