      "linePosition": 4,
      "textKind": "line_statement",
      "text": "六四：括囊，無咎無譽。",
      "source": {
        "sourceId": "module-four-acceptance-pack",
        "sourceVersion": "2026-07-25-candidate-v1",
        "sourceLocator": "六爻App模块四内容数据库缺失数据补全与生产验收包.txt",
